# Closed loop: learned-table dependence vs source stream variation

Exploratory probe (complete graph, closed loop, 24 exogenous schedules). One row per learner (agent × instance). *tab-dependent*: the learner's learned tables depend on the schedule. *source stream varies*: what at least one of its sources emits depends on the schedule.

## Rule set: set (400 instances; 0 skipped as unresolved)

|  | learner tab-dependent | learner tab-invariant |
|---|---|---|
| source stream varies | 49 | 410 |
| source streams fixed | 0 | 741 |

The learner's own behaviour vs its own learned tables:

|  | own tables fixed | own tables vary |
|---|---|---|
| own behaviour fixed | 897 | 12 |
| own behaviour varies | 254 | 37 |

